Not ours to license
-------------------
data/imgt/*.fasta are IMGT germline reference sequences, redistributed here only
to place CDR3 boundaries reproducibly. They remain subject to IMGT's terms of
use (https://www.imgt.org/) and should be cited as IMGT/GENE-DB, not as part of
this work.

The repertoire databases themselves -- VDJdb, McPAS-TCR and NeoTCR -- are not
redistributed in any form. This repository ships the download and normalization
code plus the accessions; obtain the source files from their maintainers under
their own terms.
